readlicense_oo	docs\readme\readme.xrm	0	readmeitem	ooo_readme.FileLocking.G2	pji76w			0	sa-IN	मूलभूतनिर्धारणे, ${PRODUCTNAME}मध्ये फैल् पिधानं उदाघाटितम्।तत् निष्प्रकारयितुं, त्वं यथार्थवातावरणपरिवर्तनीयानि स्थापनीयं SAL_ENABLE_FILE_LOCKING=0  SAL_ENABLE_FILE_LOCKING निर्याणं च कुरु।एते निवेशाः सोफिस् स्क्रिप्ट् सञ्चिकायां प्रकारितफोर्म् मध्ये पूर्वमेव सन्ति।				2002-02-02 02:02:02
readlicense_oo	docs\readme\readme.xrm	0	readmeitem	ooo_readme.FileLocking.G3	pji76wsdf			0	sa-IN	Warning: The activated file locking feature can cause problems with Solaris 2.5.1 and 2.7 used in conjunction with Linux NFS 2.0. If your system environment has these parameters, we strongly recommend that you avoid using the file locking feature. Otherwise, ${PRODUCTNAME} will hang when you try to open a file from a NFS mounted directory from a Linux computer.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
